# Welcome wizard
#: includes/class-dashboard.php:315
msgid "Welcome to PointNet Mail Guard!"
msgstr "Benvenuto in PointNet Mail Guard!"

#: includes/class-dashboard.php:318
msgid ""
"Set up your monitoring in 2 minutes. We automatically analyze 7 security "
"layers: SPF, DMARC, DKIM, MTA-STS, DNSSEC, DNSBL Blacklists, and Mail Server "
"IP/PTR."
msgstr ""
"Configura il monitoraggio in 2 minuti. Analizziamo automaticamente 7 livelli "
"di sicurezza: SPF, DMARC, DKIM, MTA-STS, DNSSEC, Blacklist DNSBL e IP/PTR "
"del Mail Server."

